{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a779d6067233159a514d90c660cb0def0c6096638375bb455bdacf4d32947a04",
      "text": "letter from Cafe Parade",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b80d750494ac5813c360a36ef092c1c37fdfa89f4154f6d3a8deb010225753",
      "text": "Cafe Parade收到了第一封粉丝信。\n被信件内容深深感动的5人，希望能将“谢谢”的心情\n回馈给粉丝，于是找制作人商量。\n随之提出了举办感谢祭的提案……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010eb00a2742ee87f352d94f38fb9c43e26548a2aea7d644d19daab1f3b3e4bc",
      "text": "第6话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a779d6067233159a514d90c660cb0def0c6096638375bb455bdacf4d32947a04",
      "text": "letter from Cafe Parade",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3aa3e647b4e955053ee4e29957a7172462038e0900c3c37135dffcc8527fb04",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。听说有寄给我们的\n粉丝信送达，我就立刻赶过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde12cd903449be4a417d4c0f0a97df0718d4adabb7a7a4899fbff0f5d299b47",
      "text": "大家来得正好。\n我刚才正在整理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10676399f1979296e2a41a40efec284e55cfd916200784f31386d6ce4302f42b",
      "text": "哇……这些全都是写给我们的\n信件对吧！嘿嘿，好开心啊～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d945e4978c7ae64a534cef4579203768a06024afba4ecd979ac1fe6e72aeded",
      "text": "嗯，我也非常期待阅读呢！\n……话说，阿斯兰，你怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f53947cc8ea0a9d1dc11fa77be63d82e2b74805e6cfb3fc9bc918d67dd4c5079",
      "text": "……竟然有如此之多\n写有吾之真名的密函送达。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:594ae8fe7342e177cb40fcbb2f581f7abcad6da8deb21a875e296958fc1f968d",
      "text": "那么，便来解开封印吧！\n唔……写了些什么……竟然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ec4c4994c0716e1021a0ef22b78935ecc51d350faf9ef60ba35d5f2e3565a1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！实在太美妙了！\n吾将赐予此人撒旦的祝福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f0d45bfded1c3bbeeec8ab18cf3fd86ee2f71c60552733766f2101789b314c",
      "text": "呵呵，太好了呢。那么，\n粉丝信里写了些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d80123496f7813c298e7f947899bfb7ceb5d5a7aafa369086491a8d9e8859d",
      "text": "嗯。说是作为暗之使者歌唱、起舞的\n吾之身姿，给予了其勇气，拯救了其心灵……信中是这般写的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1105ef842d80cb20f329c48d3e6a732803fa1dd7c2f2e381d02f4a91cd8ee580",
      "text": "明明反倒是我们被那些话语所拯救了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2446fa71678f3f3dea2bc6cd43e90858ea79e2ce361db1706f82cf465549d560",
      "text": "最近315 Production的工作也变多了，大家在电视、\n在杂志等各种领域进行挑战……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80929e02012781bdd17064418b087ca146c5ac0bf2c12e06e61e350a863ac058",
      "text": "无论遇到什么都能努力坚持下去，\n都是多亏了这样的支持啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0805762415265d309292880610dac056397c66afc6bf1d5c4035d5cd8a0bee57",
      "text": "确实呢……好想向粉丝们\n传达“谢谢”的心情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
